>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `remove_field_simps`

``` hol4
seedCollections.remove_field_simps : string -> unit
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Removes a persistent theorem name from the current `field_simps`
collection.  Names may use dotted or kernel-qualified theory notation.

### See also

[`seedCollections.field_ss`](#seedCollections.field_ss)
